    "metadata": {
        "name": "g1_layergeom",
        "description": "G1 de-risk: GEOS-FP hybrid-sigma layer geometry (edge pressures, dP, hypsometric dz) via interp.linear with inline const Ap/Bp arrays and an OFFSET query (lev+1). Proves vertical layer geometry is runtime-evaluable in v0.8.0. NOTE: the higher-level `table_lookup` form parses/validates but is NOT lowered by the tree-walk simulate path (E_TREEWALK_UNSUPPORTED_OP: table_lookup); interp.linear+const is the tree-walk-native form (as fastjx.esm uses). Ap/Bp values from EarthSciModels/components/earthsci_data/geosfp.esm."
    }
}